  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SIWI Textile Ind Sustainable Water Mgmt Training</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SIWI Vattenresurshush&#xe5;llning f&#xf6;r Textilindustrin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">planeringsbidrag - SIWI i dialog med KappAhl Sverige AB och AB Lindex f&#xf6;r att tillsammans med kinesiska fabriksleverant&#xf6;rer av textil       planera gemensam utbildning r&#xf6;rande f&#xf6;rvaltning av vatten i           textilindustrin i en eller tv&#xe5; provinser i Kina, samt utforska        m&#xf6;jligheten att involvera olika partners s&#xe5; som icke-statliga         organisationer, konsulter och myndigheter i Kina.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">planning grant - SIWI in dialogue with KappAhl Sverige AB and AB      Lindex to work together with Chinese textile supplier factories and   plan a jointly-implemeted training course on water management in      textile industry in one or two provinces in China, also explore the   possibility of involving a wider range of partners such as NGO&#xb4;s,     consultants and public authorities in China.</narrative>
  </description>
